  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building for Renewable Energy and Energy Efficiency - Feasibility Studies and Demonstration Projects</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project of which this contract will be a part is to increase access to clean, reliable and affordable energy and promote renewable energy production and energy efficiency in Zambia. The purposes of the Contract are:  To help build resilient infrastructure, promote inclusive and sustainable industrialisation and addressing energy poverty in rural areas; To help take urgent action to combat climate change and its impacts; To ensure technical know-how transfer in the development of project feasibility studies for some prospective off grid sites; To demonstrate feasibility of renewable energy projects in practice.</narrative>
  </description>
